# Phase E, second seed set, DiT: clean baseline + skip the early 1-83, mid 84-166 and late 167-249 steps
# (83 each, burn kept) on lanes/p1/manifests/seed2.csv (same 7 classes x 32, master seed 61320018), with
# quality scores. Same arms as sweep_dit.env (seed 1: job 25893213). Step 0 is never cut.
#     qsub -v SETTINGS=lanes/p1/jobs/seed2_dit.env lanes/p1/jobs/gateb.pbs
# Estimated (from 25893213's steps.tsv): ~480 s baseline + 3 x ~330 s arms incl. scoring = ~25 min (+ start-up).
# The step indices become timesteps through this job's own baseline run.json (stages table).
# BASELINE_REF points at a path that does not exist on purpose: outputs/baseline/25665469 holds the seed-1
# images, and no reference baseline exists for these seeds, so the hash check reports SKIPPED (not a failure
# in gateb.pbs).
MANIFEST=lanes/p1/manifests/seed2.csv
BASELINE_REF=outputs/baseline/none_for_seed2
EXP_TAG=seed2dit
RUN_VAR=0
RUN_DIT=1
DIT_ARMS="remove_early:1-83 remove_mid:84-166 remove_late:167-249"
DIT_CUT=83
P3_RIDEALONG=0
QUALITY=1
KEEP_RAW=0
